/E (4.1 The Tariff Architecture)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
271 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 123 0 R
/E (To understand the implications on private markets, we first must establish what the tariff environment currently looks like in early 2026. The average effective tariff rate was 7.7% in 2025 \(the highest since 1947\). With the IEEPA tariffs ruled illegal in February 2026, the weighted average applied tariff rate fell from 13.8% to 6.7% under the Section 232 tariffs that remain, although a 10% Section 122 tariff has since been applied to approximately $1.2T in annual imports. )
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
272 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 123 0 R
/E <>
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
