/P 125 0 R
/T (This is leading to a partial regionalisation of Gulf capital, with increased allocation towards things such as domestic ecosystems, regional megaprojects and partnerships within politically aligned markets. For venture capital, this shift is particularly relevant as Gulf-backed capital has historically played a critical role in funding late-stage growth rounds globally. Any disruption to this flow has second-order effects across the global funding environment.)
/E (This is leading to a partial regionalisation of Gulf capital, with increased allocation towards things such as domestic ecosystems, regional megaprojects and partnerships within politically aligned markets. For venture capital, this shift is particularly relevant as Gulf-backed capital has historically played a critical role in funding late-stage growth rounds globally. Any disruption to this flow has second-order effects across the global funding environment.)
