/T (Similarly, Southeast Asian markets such as Vietnam and Indonesia are attracting significant inflows, particularly in manufacturing, logistics and consumer technology. These countries are benefiting from supply chain diversification strategies, as global corporations seek to reduce reliance on China. Venture capital is following this shift, backing startups that enable and scale within these newly emerging economic hubs. This corridor reflects a broader pattern where capital is no longer purely chasing growth but also geopolitical alignment and supply chain resilience. )
/E (Similarly, Southeast Asian markets such as Vietnam and Indonesia are attracting significant inflows, particularly in manufacturing, logistics and consumer technology. These countries are benefiting from supply chain diversification strategies, as global corporations seek to reduce reliance on China. Venture capital is following this shift, backing startups that enable and scale within these newly emerging economic hubs. This corridor reflects a broader pattern where capital is no longer purely chasing growth but also geopolitical alignment and supply chain resilience. )
/Pg 19 0 R
