/P 127 0 R
/E (While Europe historically had an important Defence industry, the June 2025 NATO Summit in The Hague was the catalyst that changed the way Defence was funded. Heads of state agreed to a target of 5% of GDP on Defence by 2035, more than doubling the long-standing 2% benchmark. From there, national and institutional capitals flowed toward the industry.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
