/P 128 0 R
/E (The private investment ecosystem mobilizing around these public anchors has transformed radically since 2022. According to the NATO Innovation Fund, European Defence, Security and Resilience \(DSR\) startups raised a record $8.7 billion in VC in 2025, a 55% increase year-on-year and nearly four times higher than five years ago. AI dominated the sector, underpinning 44% of all DSR funding. Late-stage investment tripled to $4.7 billion, signaling ecosystem maturation.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [4]
>>
