/P 129 0 R
/E (The Iran conflict sent energy markets into a tailspin almost immediately. Brent crude surged and European gas prices roughly doubled as markets started pricing in Strait of Hormuz disruption risk, a chokepoint for around 20% of global oil supply. For infrastructure funds, that means long-duration energy assets are being repriced in real time. )
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
339 0 obj
<<
