/P 130 0 R
/E (Tech, and chips specifically, is where the US-China fracture has been most structural. Export controls now cover over 200 product categories, and the bifurcation of the global semiconductor supply chain into two parallel ecosystems is no longer a future scenario, it's happening. )
/Pg 23 0 R
