/Title (Technology has proven to be the most resilient in the wake of the 2025 tariffs. The technology sector beat the broader trend in Q2 2025, recording its most impressive exit quarter since late 2021, with digital transformation trends shielding it relative to more trade-exposed sectors.)
/Dest [17 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
